{"overview":"کروز مانوئلوس، یک تفنگدار جوان دریایی با ظاهری خشن اما پرشور، جهت پیوستن به گروه درگیری شیرزنِ سازمان سیا استخدام می‌شود تا به سرنگونی یک سازمان تروریستی از درون کمک کند. جو، رئیس مرکز برنامه شیرزن، وظیفه آموزش، مدیریت و رهبری زنان مأمور مخفی خود را بر عهده دارد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Cruz Manuelos, a rough-around-the-edges but passionate young Marine, is recruited to join the CIA's Lioness Engagement Team to help bring down a terrorist organization from within. Joe, the station chief of the Lioness program, is tasked with training, managing and leading her female undercover operatives.","tagline_en":"This wasn't the mission.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":8,"y":2023,"poster":"/arBtKhqoVCVk6eUmDFH9JOng4BN.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":8,"y":2024,"poster":"/7n2aLblr9YpbWfZtgoKCdOz4Ezo.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":8,"y":2026,"poster":"/xv22gYEYKPJm6joCfbHYaD6gVkc.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":["تیلور شریدان"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"زوئی سالدانا","role":"Joe McNamara","photo":"/vQBwmsSOAd0JDaEcZ5p43J9xzsY.jpg"},{"name":"Laysla De Oliveira","role":"Cruz Manuelos","photo":"/3hWOSY5ZXoyzp94OzGaooURK9hn.jpg"},{"name":"Dave Annable","role":"Neal McNamara","photo":"/5DXu9ZiB4dfqNmHIOGnhXMBouPP.jpg"},{"name":"جیل واگنر","role":"Bobby","photo":"/gFtPDkS14CoDqNGnHsxNmaXZcGj.jpg"},{"name":"LaMonica Garrett","role":"Tucker","photo":"/yE5TBZ2qC5LAPDduBQAERo7EF3r.jpg"},{"name":"James Jordan","role":"Two Cups","photo":"/8flzkBpcrl0QqjDnXhbg52rsNOY.jpg"},{"name":"Genesis Rodriguez","role":"Captain Josephina 'Josie' Carrillo","photo":"/gUI9KADVjfHiI8nMc87hkeaWEF3.jpg"},{"name":"مایکل کلی","role":"Byron Westfield","photo":"/6MI8HhX1GWbcrWG8DiHffzmqaVm.jpg"},{"name":"Austin Hébert","role":"Randy","photo":"/vOuRMtOtPVd8vuNCCxxavQSdGIC.jpg"},{"name":"Jonah Wharton","role":"Tex","photo":"/4wisMOLFgPPQxm7gQO9wSI72O08.jpg"},{"name":"Hannah Love Lanier","role":"Kate McNamara","photo":"/9Jwa7ko0GoMi1TPRgwm